FWPEg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af34HQXD9p-2H-qfbiU4irNM_PI9meGcuWWOxFGr5RXrxA&oe=69F0BA51"}, {"file_name": "SS6.png", "id": "2487265508271117", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393516_2487265511604450_2683266361515773971_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=joTpTjmytkkQ7kNvwGDuMS_&_nc_oc=AdptQTiliX57W2jNLOC5EeUa4gsTd8EEQVSbd6JKw4ihwECxwd2P7xgLpJSHGGEz6hM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af2hXJmWEmrpiyhd7-c38Xnlupk5zVoV1rvewINLWnY-Bw&oe=69F0B50D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Green Garden", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Green Garden \u2013 A VR Botanical Experience \ud83c\udf3f\nStep into Green Garden, a fully immersive virtual reality experience where you can explore and interact with a beautifully designed botanical environment. Discover exotic plants, engage with nature, and enjoy a relaxing yet educational journey in a unique VR setting.\n\nKey Features:\n\u2705 Explore a detailed greenhouse environment \u2013 Designed to showcase a carefully curated selection of plants.\n\u2705 Interactive mechanics \u2013 Scan, water, and fertilize plants while observing their real-time reactions.\n\u2705 Dynamic environment \u2013 Experience realistic lighting and environmental effects that adapt to different times of the day.\n\u2705 Immersive sound design \u2013 Enjoy high-quality ambient sounds that enhance the atmosphere and realism of the experience.\n\u2705 Relaxing and educational \u2013 Learn fascinating details about plant species while immersing yourself in a peaceful, interactive world.", "short_description": "A Unique VR Botanical Journey\n\nEngage with nature in Green Garden, where every interaction is designed to offer both relaxation and discovery in a beautifully crafted VR greenhouse."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://contenidoecuagenera.github.io/green-garden-privacy/privacy-policy.htm